{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22665","headline":"和钱员外早冬玩禁中新菊 · 白居易","name":"和钱员外早冬玩禁中新菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禁署寒气迟，孟冬菊初坼。\n新黄间繁绿，烂若金照碧。\n仙郎小隐日，心似陶彭泽。\n秋怜潭上看，日惯篱边摘。\n今来此地赏，野意潜自适。\n金马门内花，玉山峰下客。\n寒芳引清句，吟玩烟景夕。\n赐酒色偏宜，握兰香不敌。\n凄凄百卉死，岁晚冰霜积。\n唯有此花开，殷勤助君惜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22665.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22665","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}